# Machine-checked progress roots for the supported ESP32-S31 station path.
# A terminal capability needs complete production ownership, host coverage,
# executable vendor proof (or an explicit not-applicable classification), HIL
# qualification and bounded/non-applicable scheduling.
ledger-version 1
target esp32s31-wifi-sta
disposition-manifest validation/esp32s31/dispositions/phy.disposition
require-capability cold-registration
require-capability rf-bb-initialization
require-capability channel-selection-switch
require-capability rx-tx-dma
require-capability interrupt-recovery
require-capability authentication-association
require-capability wpa2
require-capability async-deadlines
require-capability power-management
require-capability timeout-error-recovery

capability cold-registration
title Cold PHY registration
scope One cold register_chipv7_phy composition through the typed target port
implementation complete
host-proof covered
vendor-proof mapped
hil-proof partial
async-proof bounded
owner crates/esp32s31/phy/src/phy_register.rs PhyRegisterTransition
owner crates/esp32s31/phy/src/executor.rs run_phy_register
test crates/esp32s31/phy/src/phy_register.rs stuck_i2c_reset_fails_only_after_bounded_async_samples_and_cleans_up
vendor-root archive register_chipv7_phy
hil-evidence docs/hil/2026-07-31-driver-repo-he20-bidirectional.md HIL_OPEN_HE20_DRIVER_REPO_BIDIRECTIONAL_2026_07_31
depends-on rf-bb-initialization
gap vendor registration-root-contract-blocked-by-bb-init
gap hil cold-registration-needs-post-refactor-requalification

capability rf-bb-initialization
title RF and baseband initialization
scope Cold phy_rf_init and phy_bb_init transitions needed by Wi-Fi registration
implementation complete
host-proof covered
