owner crates/esp32s31/phy/src/phy_bb.rs PhyBbInitTransition
test crates/esp32s31/phy/src/phy_cold.rs open_i2c_deadline_keeps_one_epoch_and_the_inclusive_rom_bound
test crates/esp32s31/phy/src/phy_bb.rs complete_parent_failure_always_restores_idle_mode_and_agc
vendor-root archive phy_rf_init
vendor-root archive phy_bb_init
hil-evidence docs/hil/2026-07-31-driver-repo-he20-bidirectional.md HIL_OPEN_HE20_DRIVER_REPO_BIDIRECTIONAL_2026_07_31
gap vendor bb-init-contract-and-blocker-chain-incomplete
gap hil rf-bb-needs-post-refactor-requalification

